1
00:01:37,610 --> 00:01:42,920
[Spring of The Blade]

2
00:01:43,340 --> 00:01:46,039
[Episode 17]

3
00:01:52,070 --> 00:01:53,590
So this is the wish-granting tree

4
00:01:53,590 --> 00:01:54,590
you told me about?

5
00:01:58,470 --> 00:01:59,200
Wait here.

6
00:02:03,000 --> 00:02:05,280
Sir, one wishing plaque, please.

7
00:02:05,510 --> 00:02:06,150
Thank you.

8
00:02:11,120 --> 00:02:11,960
Make a wish.

9
00:02:32,030 --> 00:02:32,890
Your Lordship,

10
00:02:33,190 --> 00:02:34,390
what did you wish for?

11
00:02:35,120 --> 00:02:36,920
Whether my wish comes true or not

12
00:02:37,000 --> 00:02:38,070
doesn't depend on the will of Heaven,

13
00:02:38,070 --> 00:02:39,270
but solely on myself.

14
00:02:42,310 --> 00:02:43,430
So this wish of mine

15
00:02:44,840 --> 00:02:46,030
is for you.

16
00:02:49,190 --> 00:02:50,520
I wish you

17
00:02:50,680 --> 00:02:52,140
auspiciousness every day

18
00:02:52,400 --> 00:02:54,329
and that all your wishes come true.

19
00:03:19,470 --> 00:03:20,590
Shen Run,

20
00:03:21,150 --> 00:03:22,600
I saw you in him

21
00:03:23,000 --> 00:03:24,360
once again.

22
00:03:25,070 --> 00:03:28,360
Now, I can no longer tell
the difference between you two.

23
00:03:29,680 --> 00:03:31,280
Is he the person I'm missing?

24
00:03:32,360 --> 00:03:34,760
Perhaps you two
really are the same person.

25
00:03:43,150 --> 00:03:43,960
It's said that

26
00:03:44,750 --> 00:03:47,870
Lord Yan Rui from the capital

27
00:03:48,870 --> 00:03:50,680
has swift and decisive methods

28
00:03:51,030 --> 00:03:53,050
and a heart of steel.

29
00:03:53,430 --> 00:03:54,800
He kills corrupt officials,

30
00:03:54,800 --> 00:03:55,930
suppresses famine,

31
00:03:56,240 --> 00:03:57,910
and exterminates northern bandits.

32
00:03:57,910 --> 00:03:59,680
The whole nation is shocked,

33
00:04:00,240 --> 00:04:02,240
and the people praise him.

34
00:04:02,400 --> 00:04:03,680
Great!

35
00:04:08,030 --> 00:04:09,080
But everyone,

36
00:04:09,430 --> 00:04:10,840
do you really think

37
00:04:11,240 --> 00:04:13,470
he is a court official?

38
00:04:16,750 --> 00:04:18,070
An informant

39
00:04:18,310 --> 00:04:19,720
has brought news.

40
00:04:20,720 --> 00:04:21,990
That Lord Yan

41
00:04:22,510 --> 00:04:24,190
isn't even surnamed Yan!

42
00:04:25,000 --> 00:04:26,240
He's a

43
00:04:26,510 --> 00:04:28,630
fake!

44
00:04:28,920 --> 00:04:30,000
A fake?

45
00:04:30,030 --> 00:04:31,030
He's a fake.

46
00:04:31,050 --> 00:04:31,750
A fake?

47
00:04:36,070 --> 00:04:36,630
My Lady.

48
00:04:37,510 --> 00:04:39,000
Lord Yan asked me to tell you

49
00:04:39,000 --> 00:04:39,970
that Cui is fine now

50
00:04:39,970 --> 00:04:41,510
and will be released from prison soon.

51
00:04:41,510 --> 00:04:42,430
Okay, got it.

52
00:04:44,510 --> 00:04:45,270
Did you hear?

53
00:04:45,920 --> 00:04:47,680
That Lord Yan,
who provided disaster relief,

54
00:04:47,680 --> 00:04:48,630
is a fake.

55
00:04:49,560 --> 00:04:50,240
What?

56
00:04:50,800 --> 00:04:52,240
Impersonating a court official

57
00:04:52,240 --> 00:04:53,840
is a capital offense!

58
00:04:54,120 --> 00:04:54,920
Keep your voice down.

59
00:04:54,920 --> 00:04:55,800
People are watching.

60
00:04:55,800 --> 00:04:58,000
The real Lord Yan is already dead.

61
00:04:58,950 --> 00:05:00,360
This person right now

62
00:05:00,800 --> 00:05:02,430
is just a mere commoner

63
00:05:02,430 --> 00:05:03,750
who borrowed the identity,

64
00:05:03,750 --> 00:05:04,800
took the title,

65
00:05:04,800 --> 00:05:06,200
and transformed himself

66
00:05:06,240 --> 00:05:09,240
into a great official!

67
00:05:12,070 --> 00:05:13,650
Is that so?

68
00:05:13,870 --> 00:05:15,480
You ask who he is?

69
00:05:16,190 --> 00:05:18,070
It's scary to say.

70
00:05:18,270 --> 00:05:20,720
This person walks the dark path

71
00:05:21,000 --> 00:05:22,430
and talks about rules.

72
00:05:22,870 --> 00:05:23,950
His sword never leaves his side.

73
00:05:23,950 --> 00:05:26,270
When unsheathed, it must see blood.

74
00:05:26,800 --> 00:05:27,630
Legend has it

75
00:05:27,800 --> 00:05:29,190
that in one night,

76
00:05:29,310 --> 00:05:31,720
he beheaded 17 people.

77
00:05:32,000 --> 00:05:33,120
No one has seen him

78
00:05:34,000 --> 00:05:35,680
strike a second time.

79
00:05:35,950 --> 00:05:37,560
Now you know

80
00:05:37,750 --> 00:05:39,800
why he comes from
a civil official background,

81
00:05:39,800 --> 00:05:43,430
but can brave the northern bandits.

82
00:05:43,600 --> 00:05:44,270
What?

83
00:05:44,430 --> 00:05:45,960
So he's a bandit.

84
00:05:46,150 --> 00:05:48,630
No wonder he acts so unconventionally.

85
00:05:48,950 --> 00:05:50,080
So what if he is fake?

86
00:05:50,510 --> 00:05:52,270
We still like him even if he is fake.

87
00:05:52,270 --> 00:05:54,120
He works for us common people.

88
00:05:54,120 --> 00:05:54,610
Yes.

89
00:05:54,630 --> 00:05:54,920
Yes.

90
00:05:54,950 --> 00:05:57,350
What?
Are we not allowed to speak our minds?

91
00:05:58,720 --> 00:06:00,750
Between true and false,

92
00:06:01,000 --> 00:06:03,040
it's hard to tell loyalty from treason.

93
00:06:03,040 --> 00:06:05,750
Listen to me tell you

94
00:06:06,680 --> 00:06:07,630
the details.

95
00:06:10,270 --> 00:06:11,950
In just one night,

96
00:06:11,950 --> 00:06:14,010
the rumors about Lord Yan's identity

97
00:06:14,240 --> 00:06:15,970
have spread all over Hengtang.

98
00:06:17,430 --> 00:06:19,090
Qingyuan, if you are worried,

99
00:06:19,270 --> 00:06:20,600
why don't you go see him?

100
00:06:26,480 --> 00:06:27,560
I heard

101
00:06:28,000 --> 00:06:29,730
Concubine Mei is not doing well

102
00:06:30,070 --> 00:06:32,200
and might be sent out of the residence.

103
00:06:33,360 --> 00:06:34,680
She deserves it.

104
00:07:07,510 --> 00:07:08,480
Fourth Lady.

105
00:07:10,190 --> 00:07:11,560
The case is settled.

106
00:07:11,920 --> 00:07:12,920
You can leave now.

107
00:07:14,160 --> 00:07:14,750
Yes.

108
00:07:16,160 --> 00:07:18,090
Have you thought about where to go?

109
00:07:20,870 --> 00:07:22,040
Can someone like me

110
00:07:23,390 --> 00:07:25,040
still choose my own future?

111
00:07:28,570 --> 00:07:29,300
Yes, you can.

112
00:07:30,190 --> 00:07:32,120
I can arrange a new identity for you

113
00:07:33,430 --> 00:07:35,560
and give you some money to settle down.

114
00:07:35,680 --> 00:07:37,240
You can go anywhere,

115
00:07:38,070 --> 00:07:39,360
choose to get married,

116
00:07:40,000 --> 00:07:41,460
or start a small business.

117
00:07:42,310 --> 00:07:43,040
You can live

118
00:07:43,060 --> 00:07:44,820
any kind of life you want.

119
00:07:45,150 --> 00:07:46,280
No one will know you.

120
00:07:53,870 --> 00:07:55,310
What do you need me to do?

121
00:07:58,800 --> 00:08:00,800
You don't need to do anything for me.

122
00:08:06,120 --> 00:08:06,720
Do you

123
00:08:07,310 --> 00:08:08,240
not hate me?

124
00:08:11,160 --> 00:08:12,680
You were just a pawn.

125
00:08:14,160 --> 00:08:15,360
Even without you,

126
00:08:16,560 --> 00:08:18,160
there would be someone else.

127
00:08:22,270 --> 00:08:23,040
Cui'er,

128
00:08:23,920 --> 00:08:25,160
live your life well.

129
00:08:25,950 --> 00:08:27,410
When you have the ability,

130
00:08:27,950 --> 00:08:29,190
help those around you

131
00:08:29,870 --> 00:08:32,130
so they can also have the right to choose.

132
00:08:33,120 --> 00:08:35,179
That would be the best way to repay me.

133
00:08:41,720 --> 00:08:42,669
Thank you.

134
00:09:12,600 --> 00:09:13,320
Baoxian.

135
00:09:17,480 --> 00:09:18,030
Baoxian.

136
00:09:21,720 --> 00:09:22,650
She fell asleep.

137
00:09:31,360 --> 00:09:32,750
Isn't Lord Yan with you?

138
00:09:33,890 --> 00:09:35,820
I'm here precisely because of him.

139
00:09:36,390 --> 00:09:37,480
Do you know

140
00:09:37,720 --> 00:09:39,120
he bears heavy responsibilities?

141
00:09:37,760 --> 00:09:40,850
[Danyue Pavilion]

142
00:09:39,550 --> 00:09:40,680
Now, because of you,

143
00:09:40,960 --> 00:09:42,030
he is distracted

144
00:09:42,750 --> 00:09:44,610
and delaying important matters.

145
00:09:44,870 --> 00:09:46,150
If you know him,

146
00:09:46,510 --> 00:09:47,640
you should know that

147
00:09:47,870 --> 00:09:49,270
once he makes up his mind,

148
00:09:49,360 --> 00:09:50,440
no one can sway him.

149
00:09:50,840 --> 00:09:52,900
It's impossible
for me to change him.

150
00:09:53,270 --> 00:09:54,360
This path

151
00:09:54,480 --> 00:09:56,440
guarantees certain death.

152
00:09:56,960 --> 00:09:58,510
Any slight distraction

153
00:09:58,910 --> 00:10:00,670
will make him fail completely.

154
00:10:01,080 --> 00:10:03,440
So having you by his side

155
00:10:03,910 --> 00:10:05,710
is a disaster waiting to happen.

156
00:10:11,540 --> 00:10:12,600
[Danyue Pavilion]

157
00:10:12,080 --> 00:10:12,670
Che.

158
00:10:14,360 --> 00:10:15,240
Step aside!

159
00:10:15,670 --> 00:10:17,720
If you still remember your family name,

160
00:10:17,720 --> 00:10:19,450
let me get rid of this disaster!

161
00:10:19,550 --> 00:10:20,870
For what we need to do,

162
00:10:20,870 --> 00:10:22,000
what good does it do?

163
00:10:22,120 --> 00:10:23,320
If it reminds you

164
00:10:23,630 --> 00:10:25,490
of our family's deep grievances,

165
00:10:25,720 --> 00:10:27,540
her death won't be in vain!

166
00:10:33,140 --> 00:10:34,470
[Danyue Pavilion]

167
00:10:40,080 --> 00:10:40,720
Che.

168
00:10:41,440 --> 00:10:42,960
I have never forgotten.

169
00:10:43,480 --> 00:10:44,550
For so many years,

170
00:10:45,240 --> 00:10:46,900
I lived like a walking corpse.

171
00:10:47,480 --> 00:10:48,870
Only when I am by her side

172
00:10:49,720 --> 00:10:51,120
do I feel alive.

173
00:10:53,560 --> 00:10:55,990
[Danyue Pavilion]

174
00:10:56,270 --> 00:10:57,910
You only have one life.

175
00:10:58,790 --> 00:11:00,450
You have a mission to fulfill.

176
00:11:00,510 --> 00:11:03,150
The sword in your hand
cannot rust because of feelings.

177
00:11:03,150 --> 00:11:04,480
Think it through.

178
00:11:17,360 --> 00:11:18,090
Are you okay?

179
00:11:19,270 --> 00:11:20,080
I'm fine.

180
00:11:21,080 --> 00:11:21,840
Who is he?

181
00:11:22,630 --> 00:11:25,490
And what are the deep grievances
he just mentioned?

182
00:11:27,630 --> 00:11:28,830
Living in this world,

183
00:11:29,270 --> 00:11:31,270
it's inevitable to have some feuds.

184
00:11:34,630 --> 00:11:36,670
He and I walked out of the same hell.

185
00:11:37,670 --> 00:11:39,270
We bear the same blood debts.

186
00:11:40,200 --> 00:11:41,000
It's just that

187
00:11:42,080 --> 00:11:43,480
he suffers more than I do.

188
00:12:13,440 --> 00:12:15,640
Yan Rui thinks I'm acting out of hatred,

189
00:12:16,590 --> 00:12:18,320
hating him for falling in love.

190
00:12:19,240 --> 00:12:19,960
No.

191
00:12:20,550 --> 00:12:21,360
He is wrong.

192
00:12:23,360 --> 00:12:25,560
What I fear is not Xie Qingyuan herself,

193
00:12:26,840 --> 00:12:29,770
but the people possibly
pulling strings behind her.

194
00:12:30,510 --> 00:12:32,770
The Xie family knows too well how to kill.

195
00:12:32,840 --> 00:12:34,500
What if they don't use blades,

196
00:12:34,630 --> 00:12:35,790
but tenderness?

197
00:12:36,630 --> 00:12:39,080
You can't gamble your life
on a moment of weakness.

198
00:12:39,080 --> 00:12:41,240
Xie Qingyuan might be innocent,

199
00:12:41,750 --> 00:12:43,200
but what I must do

200
00:12:42,270 --> 00:12:49,680
[Frugality Cultivates Virtue]

201
00:12:43,440 --> 00:12:44,970
cannot risk any "what-ifs"

202
00:12:45,120 --> 00:12:46,510
and "perhaps."

203
00:12:47,120 --> 00:12:49,150
I'm not killing your beloved.

204
00:12:49,600 --> 00:12:51,320
I'm just eliminating every

205
00:12:51,320 --> 00:12:53,380
possibility that could destroy you.

206
00:13:04,390 --> 00:13:05,080
Che.

207
00:13:05,510 --> 00:13:06,840
What are you doing here?

208
00:13:07,670 --> 00:13:09,400
Do you know how agonizing it was

209
00:13:09,870 --> 00:13:11,840
to lie under Mother's dead body,

210
00:13:12,960 --> 00:13:14,360
and feel her body

211
00:13:15,360 --> 00:13:16,720
turn cold

212
00:13:18,000 --> 00:13:19,000
bit by bit?

213
00:13:20,390 --> 00:13:21,670
Do you know that

214
00:13:22,200 --> 00:13:24,260
I crawled out of a pile of dead bodies?

215
00:13:25,960 --> 00:13:28,840
I faced that dead silence for so long.

216
00:13:30,390 --> 00:13:31,320
Those people

217
00:13:32,080 --> 00:13:34,240
were all our family.

218
00:13:43,670 --> 00:13:44,790
You don't know.

219
00:13:46,000 --> 00:13:46,790
That's why,

220
00:13:47,670 --> 00:13:49,440
for your own selfish feelings,

221
00:13:50,840 --> 00:13:51,440
you forgot

222
00:13:52,750 --> 00:13:54,880
the responsibility on our shoulders.

223
00:14:04,030 --> 00:14:04,790
Che.

224
00:14:06,080 --> 00:14:08,340
I really thought you were dead back then.

225
00:14:10,910 --> 00:14:12,670
Until I saw you again later,

226
00:14:15,960 --> 00:14:18,090
I didn't know you had suffered so much.

227
00:14:19,840 --> 00:14:20,600
Yes.

228
00:14:24,000 --> 00:14:25,670
I've fallen for Qingyuan.

229
00:14:28,550 --> 00:14:30,010
If hatred is involuntary,

230
00:14:30,150 --> 00:14:31,080
what about love?

231
00:14:32,480 --> 00:14:34,120
Can I control love?

232
00:14:38,440 --> 00:14:39,440
But I know

233
00:14:41,510 --> 00:14:42,910
I can control my own life.

234
00:14:47,270 --> 00:14:49,200
My life is tied to yours.

235
00:14:50,840 --> 00:14:53,240
Before our father's name is cleared,

236
00:14:54,630 --> 00:14:57,120
and before our enemies pay in blood,

237
00:14:59,870 --> 00:15:01,240
I will never waver.

238
00:15:16,750 --> 00:15:17,910
I just hope...

239
00:15:19,670 --> 00:15:22,200
I just hope that
after we resolve everything,

240
00:15:24,270 --> 00:15:25,530
we can let go of the past

241
00:15:27,750 --> 00:15:28,880
and live a good life.

242
00:15:40,870 --> 00:15:42,120
Somebody...

243
00:15:46,270 --> 00:15:47,510
Somebody!

244
00:15:50,030 --> 00:15:50,840
Second Madam,

245
00:15:51,390 --> 00:15:52,850
it is time for you to leave.

246
00:15:53,630 --> 00:15:54,750
Where am I going?

247
00:15:55,790 --> 00:15:57,480
On the orders of the Head Madam,

248
00:15:57,480 --> 00:15:59,030
I am to take you to the estate

249
00:15:59,440 --> 00:16:00,960
to pray for the Old Madam.

250
00:16:04,630 --> 00:16:06,150
I am not going.

251
00:16:08,510 --> 00:16:10,570
Since marrying into this residence,

252
00:16:11,240 --> 00:16:13,630
I never planned to leave this house.

253
00:16:16,030 --> 00:16:18,030
I'm not going anywhere.

254
00:16:18,910 --> 00:16:20,480
I almost forgot.

255
00:16:21,440 --> 00:16:22,670
Eldest Young Master

256
00:16:23,790 --> 00:16:24,870
has sent a letter.

257
00:16:28,510 --> 00:16:30,080
Give my son's letter

258
00:16:30,870 --> 00:16:31,840
to me.

259
00:16:32,070 --> 00:16:34,100
[Respectfully to Madam Mei of the Xie
family in Hengtang, from Xie Zhenglun]

260
00:16:32,240 --> 00:16:34,150
After committing such a grave mistake,

261
00:16:34,150 --> 00:16:37,390
you don't deserve to read the letter
from a Xie family descendant.

262
00:16:37,390 --> 00:16:38,910
You lowly maidservant!

263
00:16:41,600 --> 00:16:42,790
From now on,

264
00:16:42,840 --> 00:16:46,550
-the Eldest and Second Young Master
-Give me the letter.

265
00:16:47,840 --> 00:16:50,500
will be registered
under the Head Madam's name.

266
00:16:51,390 --> 00:16:52,150
Take her away.

267
00:16:52,150 --> 00:16:52,480
Yes.

268
00:16:52,480 --> 00:16:53,870
You lowly maidservant!

269
00:16:54,240 --> 00:16:55,750
Give me the letter!

270
00:16:56,000 --> 00:16:56,910
Stop!

271
00:16:56,910 --> 00:16:58,000
What are you doing?

272
00:16:58,120 --> 00:16:59,150
Second Young Master.

273
00:16:59,150 --> 00:16:59,610
Mother.

274
00:17:00,360 --> 00:17:00,910
Mother!

275
00:17:03,960 --> 00:17:04,510
Get lost!

276
00:17:08,550 --> 00:17:09,480
Zhengjun.

277
00:17:09,790 --> 00:17:10,349
Mother.

278
00:17:10,750 --> 00:17:12,270
Help me.

279
00:17:14,400 --> 00:17:16,200
Your brother sent a letter.

280
00:17:18,030 --> 00:17:19,680
When he left,

281
00:17:20,960 --> 00:17:23,069
I couldn't even see him off.

282
00:17:25,310 --> 00:17:30,110
I want to see
what he said to me in the letter.

283
00:17:31,440 --> 00:17:33,720
-Mother.
-Help me.

284
00:17:34,030 --> 00:17:34,510
Okay.

285
00:17:34,920 --> 00:17:35,270
Okay.

286
00:17:35,480 --> 00:17:37,440
Mother, don't worry.

287
00:17:37,480 --> 00:17:39,400
Take it easy. I will find a way.

288
00:17:39,920 --> 00:17:41,380
I will think of something.

289
00:17:52,270 --> 00:17:56,400
[Wuzhu Courtyard]

290
00:17:57,750 --> 00:17:58,400
Madam,

291
00:17:59,070 --> 00:18:00,600
the one in Liuhua Courtyard

292
00:18:00,750 --> 00:18:01,950
is probably so angry

293
00:18:02,070 --> 00:18:04,200
that she is about to draw her last breath.

294
00:18:04,200 --> 00:18:05,930
If she really doesn't survive,

295
00:18:06,480 --> 00:18:08,140
she only has herself to blame.

296
00:18:16,750 --> 00:18:18,750
She was competitive her whole life.

297
00:18:18,960 --> 00:18:19,790
Even now,

298
00:18:21,510 --> 00:18:23,400
she's still so stubborn.

299
00:18:25,680 --> 00:18:26,110
Madam,

300
00:18:26,880 --> 00:18:28,140
Young Master Zhengjun

301
00:18:28,270 --> 00:18:29,730
is still waiting outside.

302
00:18:38,950 --> 00:18:40,800
[Wuzhu Courtyard]

303
00:18:42,680 --> 00:18:43,880
Second Young Master.

304
00:18:44,000 --> 00:18:44,830
The Head Madam

305
00:18:45,510 --> 00:18:47,270
has been feeling unwell recently.

306
00:18:47,270 --> 00:18:49,480
She just lay down
and hasn't gotten up yet.

307
00:18:49,480 --> 00:18:50,310
Why don't you

308
00:18:50,920 --> 00:18:52,650
come back to visit another day?

309
00:18:53,960 --> 00:18:55,090
I'll just wait here.

310
00:19:04,510 --> 00:19:05,160
Madam.

311
00:19:05,880 --> 00:19:07,410
Young Master Zhengjun said

312
00:19:07,920 --> 00:19:09,590
he'd just wait there.

313
00:19:38,110 --> 00:19:39,000
Forget it.

314
00:19:40,790 --> 00:19:41,790
Let him in.

315
00:19:45,920 --> 00:19:46,640
Head Madam.

316
00:19:47,790 --> 00:19:49,720
I just heard my brother sent a letter.

317
00:19:49,720 --> 00:19:51,030
Could you give me the letter

318
00:19:51,030 --> 00:19:53,290
-so my mother...
-I know why you are here.

319
00:19:56,960 --> 00:19:58,270
But do you know

320
00:19:59,200 --> 00:20:01,960
why I made you kneel
in the rain for so long?

321
00:20:05,830 --> 00:20:07,070
Your brother

322
00:20:07,960 --> 00:20:09,360
went to the battlefield.

323
00:20:09,790 --> 00:20:12,650
You're now the only man in the Xie family.

324
00:20:13,000 --> 00:20:14,070
We have

325
00:20:14,350 --> 00:20:15,680
high hopes for you,

326
00:20:15,830 --> 00:20:18,070
and we hope you can be sensible

327
00:20:18,070 --> 00:20:21,070
and shoulder the responsibilities
of the Xie family.

328
00:20:21,070 --> 00:20:22,160
Your Mother

329
00:20:22,640 --> 00:20:24,240
is a sinner of the Xie family.

330
00:20:24,830 --> 00:20:26,160
According to the rules,

331
00:20:28,200 --> 00:20:30,200
she has no right to read this letter.

332
00:20:31,830 --> 00:20:32,590
So,

333
00:20:35,000 --> 00:20:36,920
I ought to withhold it.

334
00:20:39,510 --> 00:20:41,640
You are absolutely right, Head Madam.

335
00:20:42,920 --> 00:20:45,640
But the bond between my mother
and me runs deep.

336
00:20:46,680 --> 00:20:48,400
I really cannot bear to see her

337
00:20:49,240 --> 00:20:51,000
in such a difficult situation.

338
00:20:52,830 --> 00:20:54,360
Zhengjun, you've grown up.

339
00:20:56,160 --> 00:20:58,030
You know how to care for people now.

340
00:20:58,030 --> 00:20:58,720
Good.

341
00:20:59,920 --> 00:21:00,830
Good.

342
00:21:05,590 --> 00:21:08,000
I know you're a filial and good child.

343
00:21:08,640 --> 00:21:10,550
But you must understand that

344
00:21:12,310 --> 00:21:13,030
she

345
00:21:13,880 --> 00:21:15,720
is currently bearing guilt.

346
00:21:15,920 --> 00:21:17,880
If you blindly get close to her,

347
00:21:17,960 --> 00:21:18,830
I'm afraid

348
00:21:19,350 --> 00:21:21,240
it will displease your father

349
00:21:21,960 --> 00:21:25,310
and affect your bright future.

350
00:21:29,790 --> 00:21:31,030
You and Zhenglun

351
00:21:32,110 --> 00:21:34,200
are now registered under my name.

352
00:21:35,720 --> 00:21:38,270
You're like my own biological sons.

353
00:21:39,750 --> 00:21:40,680
I hope you

354
00:21:42,110 --> 00:21:44,240
understand my intentions.

355
00:21:56,440 --> 00:21:57,400
Perhaps

356
00:21:58,480 --> 00:22:00,070
your older brother's words

357
00:22:00,750 --> 00:22:05,000
will carry some weight with your father.

358
00:22:06,680 --> 00:22:07,750
I understand.

359
00:22:09,920 --> 00:22:11,180
Thank you, Head Madam.

360
00:22:27,440 --> 00:22:28,920
Mother has been locked up.

361
00:22:29,640 --> 00:22:30,640
I heard that soon,

362
00:22:31,350 --> 00:22:33,550
she will be sent to that remote estate.

363
00:22:34,830 --> 00:22:37,960
What should we do now?

364
00:22:47,060 --> 00:22:47,670
[Mother has been locked up.
I heard that soon,]

365
00:22:47,690 --> 00:22:48,300
[she will be sent
to that remote estate.]

366
00:22:48,330 --> 00:22:48,980
[What should we do now?]

367
00:22:57,200 --> 00:22:59,660
Grandmother asked me
to call you for dinner.

368
00:23:13,200 --> 00:23:14,460
No matter the problem,

369
00:23:15,480 --> 00:23:17,590
you must first take care of your health

370
00:23:17,590 --> 00:23:18,990
before thinking of a way.

371
00:23:22,240 --> 00:23:23,100
Fourth Sister.

372
00:23:24,030 --> 00:23:25,560
Do you hate my mother and me?

373
00:23:28,480 --> 00:23:29,480
Those things

374
00:23:30,200 --> 00:23:32,330
were all done by Second Madam herself.

375
00:23:32,590 --> 00:23:34,590
The sins of the parents
don't fall upon their children.

376
00:23:34,590 --> 00:23:36,850
I can still distinguish right from wrong

377
00:23:37,000 --> 00:23:39,060
and won't take my anger out on others.

378
00:23:41,440 --> 00:23:42,200
I'm sorry.

379
00:23:46,200 --> 00:23:48,400
Are you writing a letter to Big Brother?

380
00:23:50,550 --> 00:23:52,550
They're taking my mother to the estate.

381
00:23:52,550 --> 00:23:54,680
Usually, Brother makes the decisions

382
00:23:54,880 --> 00:23:56,280
on all the major matters.

383
00:23:58,240 --> 00:23:59,440
I want to consult him.

384
00:23:59,920 --> 00:24:02,850
But he is already working
very hard at the front line,

385
00:24:03,070 --> 00:24:05,930
so you don't want to bother him
with family matters?

386
00:24:09,640 --> 00:24:10,440
I'll help you.

387
00:24:16,880 --> 00:24:18,640
Everything is fine at home.

388
00:24:18,840 --> 00:24:20,580
[To my dear brother]

389
00:24:19,030 --> 00:24:19,830
Do not worry.

390
00:24:22,030 --> 00:24:24,630
The weather has been
getting colder recently.

391
00:24:25,110 --> 00:24:27,440
I hope you take care of yourself, brother.

392
00:24:27,720 --> 00:24:29,000
Put on more clothes

393
00:24:29,680 --> 00:24:31,110
and stay warm.

394
00:24:32,240 --> 00:24:33,640
Mother and I

395
00:24:34,960 --> 00:24:36,550
miss you very much.

396
00:24:36,920 --> 00:24:38,240
We pray day and night

397
00:24:38,510 --> 00:24:39,750
for your good health.

398
00:24:42,350 --> 00:24:43,410
Everything at home

399
00:24:44,030 --> 00:24:45,310
is the same.

400
00:24:46,270 --> 00:24:48,070
Mother is in good health.

401
00:24:48,790 --> 00:24:51,310
I am studying diligently

402
00:24:52,550 --> 00:24:53,810
without slacking off.

403
00:24:54,310 --> 00:24:55,480
I hope you

404
00:24:55,880 --> 00:24:57,160
can find time

405
00:24:57,440 --> 00:24:59,000
to write us a letter

406
00:25:00,350 --> 00:25:02,270
to ease our longing.

407
00:25:05,070 --> 00:25:06,350
We also pray for

408
00:25:07,310 --> 00:25:08,440
your early triumph

409
00:25:09,070 --> 00:25:10,270
and safe return home.

410
00:25:20,930 --> 00:25:21,690
[I hope you can find time
to write us a letter]

411
00:25:21,710 --> 00:25:22,930
[to ease our longing.]

412
00:25:26,110 --> 00:25:26,950
[Everything is fine at home. Do not worry.
The weather has been getting colder recently.]

413
00:25:26,970 --> 00:25:28,020
[I hope you take care of yourself, brother.
Put on more clothes and stay warm.]

414
00:25:30,750 --> 00:25:31,680
Second Brother.

415
00:25:32,240 --> 00:25:34,030
Please make sure to send a trusted person

416
00:25:34,030 --> 00:25:35,750
to deliver this to Big Brother.

417
00:25:35,750 --> 00:25:37,680
Don't let anyone else handle this.

418
00:25:44,440 --> 00:25:45,300
Fourth Sister.

419
00:25:48,720 --> 00:25:49,510
Thank you.

420
00:26:06,970 --> 00:26:10,680
[Everything is fine at home.
Do not worry.]

421
00:26:08,200 --> 00:26:10,480
Zhengjun has really grown up.

422
00:26:10,920 --> 00:26:13,200
He knows to report only the good news now.

423
00:26:16,480 --> 00:26:18,000
That won't do.

424
00:26:32,480 --> 00:26:33,700
[Your brother, Zhengjun]

425
00:26:36,680 --> 00:26:38,680
Send this to Zhenglun immediately.

426
00:26:38,960 --> 00:26:40,220
It must not be delayed.

427
00:26:40,310 --> 00:26:41,550
Yes, Madam.

428
00:26:53,160 --> 00:26:55,490
The rainy season in Hengtang has arrived.

429
00:26:56,160 --> 00:26:58,200
I wonder how many flowers and plants

430
00:26:58,200 --> 00:26:59,600
won't survive this time.

431
00:27:02,830 --> 00:27:03,640
Make way!

432
00:27:03,790 --> 00:27:05,670
[Dongmen General Store]

433
00:27:04,070 --> 00:27:04,880
Make way!

434
00:27:06,640 --> 00:27:07,510
Make way!

435
00:27:09,590 --> 00:27:10,310
Make way!

436
00:27:13,590 --> 00:27:15,250
-This way, General.
-Report!

437
00:27:16,550 --> 00:27:17,110
Please.

438
00:27:17,550 --> 00:27:19,790
To the family of General Xie Zhenglun,

439
00:27:19,790 --> 00:27:21,030
Vanguard General

440
00:27:21,240 --> 00:27:22,300
of the Ningwu Army.

441
00:27:22,830 --> 00:27:24,680
Since the flames of war
ignited at the border,

442
00:27:24,680 --> 00:27:25,510
your son Zhenglun,

443
00:27:25,510 --> 00:27:26,550
loyal and courageous,

444
00:27:26,550 --> 00:27:27,590
rose up

445
00:27:27,640 --> 00:27:28,960
and requested to fight.

446
00:27:28,960 --> 00:27:30,750
He left his home to face the crisis.

447
00:27:30,750 --> 00:27:32,400
He was besieged in an isolated city.

448
00:27:32,400 --> 00:27:33,440
The city fell,

449
00:27:34,350 --> 00:27:35,200
and to protect the people,

450
00:27:35,200 --> 00:27:36,400
he was pierced by countless arrows.

451
00:27:36,400 --> 00:27:38,200
His sacrifice cannot be repaid.

452
00:27:38,550 --> 00:27:39,440
In his final moments,

453
00:27:39,440 --> 00:27:40,830
his mind was still clear.

454
00:27:40,830 --> 00:27:43,030
He remembered
your deep grace in raising him,

455
00:27:43,030 --> 00:27:45,160
and regretted that he could not
return to care for you.

456
00:27:45,160 --> 00:27:46,350
His words were choked with sobs,

457
00:27:46,350 --> 00:27:48,410
and everyone who heard him was moved.

458
00:27:48,440 --> 00:27:49,920
His loyal and courageous act

459
00:27:49,920 --> 00:27:51,030
and his awe-inspiring heroism

460
00:27:51,030 --> 00:27:52,480
are enough to be a model
for the whole army,

461
00:27:52,480 --> 00:27:53,680
and admired by future generations.

462
00:27:53,680 --> 00:27:54,810
I sincerely hope you

463
00:27:55,310 --> 00:27:56,880
and your family will restrain your grief

464
00:27:56,880 --> 00:27:58,480
and take care of yourselves.

465
00:27:58,680 --> 00:28:00,200
His heroic deeds

466
00:28:00,240 --> 00:28:01,750
will surely go down in history

467
00:28:01,750 --> 00:28:03,240
and be remembered forever.

468
00:28:03,240 --> 00:28:05,200
April 20th, 8th year of Jingxi.

469
00:28:05,480 --> 00:28:07,340
Delivered by urgent horse relay.

470
00:28:08,880 --> 00:28:11,310
Zhenglun!

471
00:28:16,400 --> 00:28:18,750
My grandson!

472
00:28:20,550 --> 00:28:24,240
How could you bear
to let an elderly like me

473
00:28:24,240 --> 00:28:28,000
bury a young man like you?

474
00:28:33,240 --> 00:28:34,170
Mother! Mother!

475
00:28:35,200 --> 00:28:37,350
Mother, please restrain your grief.

476
00:28:38,110 --> 00:28:39,920
My son!

477
00:29:06,790 --> 00:29:08,060
Second Brother.

478
00:29:08,160 --> 00:29:09,680
About the letter you sent that day,

479
00:29:09,680 --> 00:29:10,550
are you sure

480
00:29:10,640 --> 00:29:12,310
it didn't pass through
anyone else's hands?

481
00:29:12,310 --> 00:29:13,880
I don't know what to do.

482
00:29:15,030 --> 00:29:17,090
I can't care about anything else now.

483
00:29:18,240 --> 00:29:19,480
My brother is gone.

484
00:29:20,960 --> 00:29:21,920
What should I do?

485
00:29:23,270 --> 00:29:25,000
What will happen to Mother now?

486
00:29:25,720 --> 00:29:28,000
He was fine the last time he wrote.

487
00:29:32,310 --> 00:29:33,240
My condolences.

488
00:29:34,270 --> 00:29:36,550
But this matter is of great importance.

489
00:29:37,070 --> 00:29:39,200
Second Brother, please think it over.

490
00:29:39,920 --> 00:29:41,160
Here you are.

491
00:29:51,830 --> 00:29:52,430
Qingyuan.

492
00:29:55,400 --> 00:29:56,350
Come with me.

493
00:30:09,830 --> 00:30:10,880
Recently,

494
00:30:11,960 --> 00:30:14,160
much has happened in the household,

495
00:30:15,200 --> 00:30:17,600
with Zhenglun's passing being a huge blow.

496
00:30:20,480 --> 00:30:21,880
After mulling it over,

497
00:30:22,750 --> 00:30:23,830
in this family,

498
00:30:24,920 --> 00:30:25,980
I only feel assured

499
00:30:26,480 --> 00:30:28,210
entrusting this matter to you.

500
00:30:29,030 --> 00:30:30,160
Whatever you order,

501
00:30:30,590 --> 00:30:31,920
as far as I'm capable,

502
00:30:32,200 --> 00:30:33,800
I will definitely do my best.

503
00:30:47,520 --> 00:30:49,550
[Respectfully to Madam Mei
of the Xie family in Hengtang]

504
00:30:53,030 --> 00:30:54,440
This is the letter Zhenglun

505
00:30:54,440 --> 00:30:55,960
wrote to Concubine Mei.

506
00:30:56,240 --> 00:30:58,000
Concubine Mei is a sinner,

507
00:30:58,240 --> 00:31:00,480
and I was afraid
she'd cause more trouble,

508
00:31:00,480 --> 00:31:01,920
so I held onto it.

509
00:31:03,000 --> 00:31:04,000
Concubine Mei

510
00:31:04,680 --> 00:31:06,440
killed your biological mother.

511
00:31:06,440 --> 00:31:09,400
She also paid the price she deserved.

512
00:31:10,240 --> 00:31:11,550
But no matter what,

513
00:31:13,270 --> 00:31:15,400
she is Zhenglun's biological mother.

514
00:31:15,720 --> 00:31:17,580
Respect for the dead comes first.

515
00:31:17,960 --> 00:31:21,480
This letter can be considered
Zhenglun's last words.

516
00:31:22,960 --> 00:31:24,310
Take this letter

517
00:31:25,000 --> 00:31:26,330
along with the obituary

518
00:31:26,480 --> 00:31:28,210
and give them to Concubine Mei.

519
00:31:28,830 --> 00:31:29,640
If you can,

520
00:31:31,550 --> 00:31:33,920
comfort her with a few words.

521
00:31:35,750 --> 00:31:36,350
Yes.

522
00:31:47,750 --> 00:31:48,880
If you don't finish washing

523
00:31:48,880 --> 00:31:50,080
these clothes today,

524
00:31:51,960 --> 00:31:53,310
you're not allowed to eat tonight.

525
00:31:53,310 --> 00:31:55,170
You'll be locked in the woodshed!

526
00:31:56,110 --> 00:31:57,770
She's not asking me to deliver

527
00:31:58,000 --> 00:31:59,090
a letter today.

528
00:31:59,750 --> 00:32:01,400
It's clearly the last straw

529
00:32:01,830 --> 00:32:04,200
that will break Mei Yinghua.

530
00:32:09,920 --> 00:32:10,590
Nanny Qin.

531
00:32:12,830 --> 00:32:13,560
Fourth Lady,

532
00:32:13,720 --> 00:32:14,750
why are you here?

533
00:32:15,200 --> 00:32:16,860
I have to talk to Second Madam.

534
00:32:31,270 --> 00:32:33,240
Mother, on the day of my departure,

535
00:32:33,400 --> 00:32:35,110
I was unable
to bid you farewell in person.

536
00:32:35,110 --> 00:32:36,440
I feel quite regretful.

537
00:32:36,720 --> 00:32:37,930
I wonder if Zhengjun

538
00:32:38,160 --> 00:32:40,020
is taking good care of you at home.

539
00:32:40,830 --> 00:32:41,960
I miss you very much.

540
00:32:42,640 --> 00:32:44,350
After all, you are the mother

541
00:32:44,350 --> 00:32:46,550
who has cherished me since I was little.

542
00:32:46,940 --> 00:32:47,810
Mother.

543
00:32:48,060 --> 00:32:49,790
When I'm done with my work here,

544
00:32:50,000 --> 00:32:51,720
I'll go home and accompany you.

545
00:32:51,720 --> 00:32:52,880
Whether you want to chant sutras

546
00:32:52,880 --> 00:32:53,940
or go to the estate,

547
00:32:54,510 --> 00:32:56,790
I'll be there with you, alright?

548
00:32:58,590 --> 00:33:00,120
As long as my son, Zhenglun,

549
00:33:00,440 --> 00:33:01,480
is doing well,

550
00:33:03,880 --> 00:33:05,270
I am assured.

551
00:33:07,000 --> 00:33:07,920
Qingyuan.

552
00:33:09,310 --> 00:33:10,510
Thank you.

553
00:33:24,350 --> 00:33:25,680
Is there anything else?

554
00:33:30,720 --> 00:33:36,410
♪ Waiting for a dream to sink into
the depths of the night ♪

555
00:33:36,470 --> 00:33:42,540
♪ Waiting for a rain to wash away
the heat burning in my eyes ♪

556
00:33:40,070 --> 00:33:41,560
[Eighth year of Jingxi,
Emergency Delivery from the Privy Council]

557
00:33:42,610 --> 00:33:47,900
♪ Waiting for a few flowers to bloom,
then quietly fall ♪

558
00:33:46,680 --> 00:33:48,550
My son, Zhenglun!

559
00:33:47,960 --> 00:33:54,020
♪ Only then do I understand right
from what's wrong and bitter ♪

560
00:33:54,090 --> 00:34:00,280
♪ Pear blossoms drift through the courtyard,
fluttering like snowflakes in a song ♪

561
00:34:00,310 --> 00:34:06,570
♪ Singing the silence of love and hate ♪

562
00:34:06,660 --> 00:34:12,949
♪  Which moment is hypothetical,
and which is a real choice? ♪

563
00:34:12,980 --> 00:34:18,880
♪ Who is drifting aimlessly in the wind? ♪

564
00:34:16,840 --> 00:34:17,670
Zhenglun...

565
00:34:18,900 --> 00:34:25,070
♪ I wonder why joy is always
so scarce in this world ♪

566
00:34:20,800 --> 00:34:24,670
I wasn't the only one
who harmed Fifth Madam.

567
00:34:25,090 --> 00:34:31,190
♪ I wonder,
is that tear a loss or a gain? ♪

568
00:34:28,590 --> 00:34:31,630
You shouldn't have taken the blame!

569
00:34:31,210 --> 00:34:37,429
♪ Two souls trapped on the opposite banks
of life and death ♪

570
00:34:37,449 --> 00:34:43,389
♪ May you and I overcome karma's bonds ♪

571
00:35:01,280 --> 00:35:02,440
Zhenglun...

572
00:35:11,400 --> 00:35:11,920
Mother!

573
00:35:12,220 --> 00:35:17,740
♪ Waiting for a dream to sink into
the depths of the night ♪

574
00:35:13,280 --> 00:35:14,110
Zhenglun?

575
00:35:15,550 --> 00:35:16,630
Zhenglun...

576
00:35:17,770 --> 00:35:23,570
♪ Waiting for a rain to wash away
the heat burning in my eyes ♪

577
00:35:19,070 --> 00:35:19,840
Hurry.

578
00:35:23,070 --> 00:35:24,070
Come home to me.

579
00:35:23,910 --> 00:35:29,260
♪ Waiting for a few flowers to bloom,
then quietly fall ♪

580
00:35:28,320 --> 00:35:29,360
Come here.

581
00:35:29,350 --> 00:35:35,420
♪ Only then do I understand right
from what's wrong and bitter ♪

582
00:35:34,280 --> 00:35:35,110
Hurry.

583
00:35:35,660 --> 00:35:41,520
♪ Pear blossoms drift through the courtyard,
fluttering like snowflakes in a song ♪

584
00:35:41,000 --> 00:35:41,670
And you.

585
00:35:41,670 --> 00:35:42,670
I told you

586
00:35:41,680 --> 00:35:47,820
♪ Singing the silence of love and hate ♪

587
00:35:43,190 --> 00:35:44,320
to pick this flower.

588
00:35:45,110 --> 00:35:45,910
Go over there.

589
00:35:47,440 --> 00:35:48,480
Take that flowerpot away.

590
00:35:47,890 --> 00:35:54,250
♪  Which moment is hypothetical,
and which is a real choice? ♪

591
00:35:48,480 --> 00:35:49,190
Toss it.

592
00:35:52,190 --> 00:35:52,960
Clean this up.

593
00:35:52,960 --> 00:35:54,320
Third Madam is kind-hearted.

594
00:35:54,270 --> 00:36:00,310
♪ Who is drifting aimlessly in the wind? ♪

595
00:35:54,590 --> 00:35:55,880
After how Concubine Mei treated her,

596
00:35:55,880 --> 00:35:57,150
she still took the trouble to send people

597
00:35:57,150 --> 00:35:59,610
to deliver all her belongings
to the estate.

598
00:36:00,150 --> 00:36:02,760
Concubine Mei used to be
the most arrogant and domineering.

599
00:36:00,340 --> 00:36:06,280
♪ I wonder why joy is always
so scarce in this world ♪

600
00:36:02,760 --> 00:36:04,800
She always had to be
the best at everything.

601
00:36:04,800 --> 00:36:08,030
Who would have thought
she'd end up a lunatic?

602
00:36:06,300 --> 00:36:13,110
♪ I wonder,
is that tear a loss or a gain? ♪

603
00:36:09,630 --> 00:36:10,830
Sometimes, going mad

604
00:36:11,280 --> 00:36:12,480
is also a relief.

605
00:36:13,130 --> 00:36:19,060
♪ Two souls trapped on the opposite banks
of life and death ♪

606
00:36:13,190 --> 00:36:14,280
Hurry up.

607
00:36:14,840 --> 00:36:16,630
I haven't seen
Third Madam for a long time.

608
00:36:16,630 --> 00:36:18,230
I'm going to Hanxiang Parlor.

609
00:36:18,230 --> 00:36:19,180
You go back first.

610
00:36:19,180 --> 00:36:24,790
♪ May you and I overcome karma's bonds ♪

611
00:36:19,550 --> 00:36:20,280
Yes.

612
00:36:25,430 --> 00:36:33,750
♪ No more wandering and worrying ♪

613
00:36:29,320 --> 00:36:31,710
The young master is in mourning
for his mother,

614
00:36:31,710 --> 00:36:33,970
and with your eldest brother's passing,

615
00:36:34,440 --> 00:36:36,880
your eldest sister
is in an even worse mood.

616
00:36:38,760 --> 00:36:40,620
Fortunately, with your support,

617
00:36:41,030 --> 00:36:42,190
the herbal shop

618
00:36:42,320 --> 00:36:43,920
is able to operate normally.

619
00:36:47,630 --> 00:36:49,320
Eldest Sister and the Young Lord

620
00:36:49,320 --> 00:36:50,550
are deeply in love.

621
00:36:50,880 --> 00:36:53,590
They can't marry because of
the mourning period,

622
00:36:53,590 --> 00:36:54,790
which is truly a pity.

623
00:36:55,630 --> 00:36:56,960
We rise

624
00:36:56,960 --> 00:36:58,150
and fall together.

625
00:36:58,670 --> 00:37:00,470
Born into this noble household,

626
00:37:01,000 --> 00:37:02,190
we are destined

627
00:37:02,400 --> 00:37:04,670
to share its honor and disgrace.

628
00:37:05,760 --> 00:37:07,760
Who could ever remain untainted?

629
00:37:11,510 --> 00:37:13,480
So did you purge the ranks...

630
00:37:15,800 --> 00:37:18,000
also to keep the peace in the Xie family?

631
00:37:21,960 --> 00:37:23,490
What are you talking about?

632
00:37:24,000 --> 00:37:25,320
I don't understand.

633
00:37:54,920 --> 00:37:56,110
You knew

634
00:37:56,800 --> 00:37:58,460
Concubine Mei loved flowers,

635
00:37:58,800 --> 00:38:00,130
so you poisoned the soil

636
00:38:00,590 --> 00:38:02,280
and drove her insane.

637
00:38:06,480 --> 00:38:07,150
Right?

638
00:38:10,670 --> 00:38:13,070
Second Madam killed Chunqing.

639
00:38:13,710 --> 00:38:16,630
I was just avenging her.

640
00:38:20,590 --> 00:38:21,550
Third Madam.

641
00:38:22,400 --> 00:38:24,400
If you wanted to avenge my mother,

642
00:38:25,590 --> 00:38:27,990
you could have used
this poison 9 years ago.

643
00:38:28,360 --> 00:38:30,710
But why did you have to wait till today?

644
00:38:31,280 --> 00:38:33,670
Isn't it because the mastermind

645
00:38:34,590 --> 00:38:36,390
only gave you permission today?

646
00:38:44,760 --> 00:38:46,030
That day, you publicly

647
00:38:46,320 --> 00:38:47,360
testified for me

648
00:38:47,710 --> 00:38:50,040
not because Qinghe persuaded you, right?

649
00:38:50,480 --> 00:38:52,710
It was because the mastermind

650
00:38:53,510 --> 00:38:54,760
instructed you to.

651
00:38:55,960 --> 00:38:56,550
Right?

652
00:39:00,320 --> 00:39:01,190
This person

653
00:39:03,190 --> 00:39:04,450
is First Madam, right?

654
00:39:41,280 --> 00:39:42,540
Who would have thought

655
00:39:44,280 --> 00:39:46,510
that the much-wronged Head Madam

656
00:39:48,000 --> 00:39:50,480
would be the mastermind behind all this?

657
00:39:56,670 --> 00:39:58,440
It's my fault.

658
00:39:59,670 --> 00:40:00,920
I'm the one

659
00:40:02,550 --> 00:40:04,110
who harmed Chunqing

660
00:40:06,030 --> 00:40:07,480
and Fifth Madam.

661
00:40:08,230 --> 00:40:10,480
She threatened me with that

662
00:40:10,880 --> 00:40:12,590
and made me do her bidding.

663
00:40:13,440 --> 00:40:14,760
It was me.

664
00:40:18,590 --> 00:40:19,710
It was me.

665
00:40:20,510 --> 00:40:23,510
Because I could no longer bear
Second Madam's disdain

666
00:40:23,920 --> 00:40:25,110
and oppression,

667
00:40:25,760 --> 00:40:27,550
I told First Madam

668
00:40:27,920 --> 00:40:30,450
the secret that euphorbia
and Congxian Grass

669
00:40:30,840 --> 00:40:32,920
are lethal when taken together.

670
00:40:33,710 --> 00:40:35,440
But I really didn't expect that

671
00:40:35,630 --> 00:40:37,360
the one who got harmed in the end

672
00:40:38,280 --> 00:40:39,920
would be Chunqing.

673
00:40:46,190 --> 00:40:47,790
I lived in seclusion because

674
00:40:48,920 --> 00:40:51,920
I didn't want to get involved
in their fights anymore.

675
00:40:52,190 --> 00:40:55,120
I didn't want to be involved
in their crimes anymore.

676
00:40:56,150 --> 00:40:57,480
But this time...

677
00:40:58,360 --> 00:41:00,550
Although I was instigated by her,

678
00:41:01,360 --> 00:41:03,880
I really wanted to avenge Chunqing,

679
00:41:04,190 --> 00:41:05,590
so I fulfilled her wish!

680
00:41:09,840 --> 00:41:10,570
Third Madam.

681
00:41:12,960 --> 00:41:13,890
I don't hate you.

682
00:41:15,150 --> 00:41:16,280
What I hate is,

683
00:41:17,510 --> 00:41:18,840
why is it that every time

684
00:41:20,110 --> 00:41:23,110
the ones who bear the consequences
of these struggles

685
00:41:25,590 --> 00:41:27,120
are always innocent people

686
00:41:27,800 --> 00:41:29,860
like my mother and my eldest brother?

687
00:41:35,440 --> 00:41:36,230
Child.

688
00:41:38,230 --> 00:41:39,490
You don't understand.

689
00:41:40,070 --> 00:41:42,600
If the wind in this world
never stops blowing,

690
00:41:44,150 --> 00:41:45,670
the trees in this world

691
00:41:46,480 --> 00:41:48,030
will never stop swaying.

692
00:41:48,670 --> 00:41:50,440
One Concubine Mei has gone mad,

693
00:41:52,880 --> 00:41:55,960
but there will be another.

694
00:42:06,000 --> 00:42:06,760
Qingyuan!
